# Data Source Comparison

## 1. Objective

The objective of this assessment is to identify and evaluate potential review data sources for the Sciencia AI sentiment analytics platform.

The assessment focuses on practical accessibility, review text availability, metadata completeness, data quality, and suitability for downstream sentiment analysis.

## 2. Evaluation Criteria

| Criterion | Description |
|---|---|
| Review Text Availability | Whether actual user review text can be retrieved |
| Metadata Availability | Whether ratings, timestamps, review IDs, and app versions are available |
| Access Requirements | Whether API credentials, account authorization, or other permissions are required |
| Practical Accessibility | Whether data retrieval has been successfully tested |
| Data Quality | Whether the returned data is complete and usable |
| Repeatability | Whether multiple retrieval batches can be collected consistently |
| Analytical Suitability | Whether the data supports sentiment analysis and issue classification |

